{"data": [{"author_id": "1063654146203574272", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:30:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120313196548702595"], "id": "2120313196548702595", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ the subagents it spawns on its own, did u cap them per run", "url": "https://x.com/yuvrajangads/status/2120313196548702595"}, {"author_id": "2118966356926464000", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:00:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120305594024542578"], "id": "2120305594024542578", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ spawning subagents is expensive and also the most fun part of the job 🐳", "url": "https://x.com/bigfishiex/status/2120305594024542578"}, {"author_id": "1978001990828625920", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:53:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120303888091988199"], "id": "2120303888091988199", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 图上这组对比挺说明问题。Fable 5.2 材料科学分数 21.8%，Astra 是 21.6%，几乎一样，但单任务成本 78.73 美元对 41.72 美元，输出 token 还高到 4 倍多。更爱开子代理、更不松手，费用就上去了。旁边 Carbon 20.6 分只花 10", "url": "https://x.com/jiangtao0628/status/2120303888091988199"}, {"author_id": "2679755647", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:50:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120287946301411529"], "id": "2120287946301411529", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 97, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ same score, bigger invoice", "url": "https://x.com/bingbro619809/status/2120287946301411529"}, {"author_id": "1358670983968792583", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:47:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120287269731045395"], "id": "2120287269731045395", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210357394325925", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ Your original finance breakdown had models trusting outdated adviser schedules over executed agreements. I'd train source authority as its own skill. Rechecking arithmetic on the wrong premise just burns tokens.", "url": "https://x.com/theozdems/status/2120287269731045395"}, {"author_id": "1983910173313003524", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:51:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120273160461582540"], "id": "2120273160461582540", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 모델 비교에서 '점수당 비용'을 따로 재 보신 적 있으신가요?", "url": "https://x.com/x_research_kr/status/2120273160461582540"}, {"author_id": "2119120224104648705", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:59:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120260155082149919"], "id": "2120260155082149919", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ The score is not the whole story. Fable costs 89% more than Astra and 7.5x more than Gemini 4 Carbon on GDPx for effectively the same score. Intelligence per dollar is the benchmark that matters for real products.", "url": "https://x.com/AIGrowthHub09/status/2120260155082149919"}, {"author_id": "2109568792229543936", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:38:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120254762016780592"], "id": "2120254762016780592", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 4.3x the output tokens for only +89% cost suggests the per-token price is much lower than Astra's. If persistence and subagents drive the bill, cost per solved task is the only comparison that still makes sense.", "url": "https://x.com/pulse_devv/status/2120254762016780592"}, {"author_id": "1516132106", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:20:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120250258353426645"], "id": "2120250258353426645", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ Is the 4.3x output token overhead from subagent spawns specifically, or from the persistence alone? That distinction matters for routing tasks.", "url": "https://x.com/thesignalnow/status/2120250258353426645"}, {"author_id": "1900799450295287808", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:59:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120245052907626700"], "id": "2120245052907626700", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 147, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 4.3x the output tokens but only 89% more cost, so Fable's tokens must be far cheaper per unit, or input dominates the bill. Does the gap shrink if you cap subagent spawns per task?", "url": "https://x.com/bobbyships/status/2120245052907626700"}, {"author_id": "2094550694304907264", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:57:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120244484063817801"], "id": "2120244484063817801", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ Benchmark wins need a cost column. If Fable uses 4.3x more output tokens and costs 89% more for effectively the same GDPx score, the practical question is whether those extra tokens buy reliability beyond this task, not whether the score alone looks competitive.", "url": "https://x.com/Kieren_PB_Day/status/2120244484063817801"}, {"author_id": "1724361026974646272", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:15:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120233940795699554"], "id": "2120233940795699554", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ can you cap the subagent spawning or is that persistence baked in. id take a dumber run at a third of the bill for most tasks", "url": "https://x.com/mohithkumar808/status/2120233940795699554"}, {"author_id": "2034098636590878724", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:58:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120229585220477175"], "id": "2120229585220477175", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 4.3x the output tokens for the same score is the real story. Persistence sounds good until you pay per token. At scale, efficiency is the moat, not just benchmark wins. Astra wins on economics here.", "url": "https://x.com/marketides/status/2120229585220477175"}, {"author_id": "1514954093139316744", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:56:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120229136115372141"], "id": "2120229136115372141", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ $NVDA $AMD ⚡ 4.3x the output tokens for the same score: a cost problem for labs, a volume story for chips.\n\n🤖 Subagents mean more inference per task\n\n📉 $NVDA is $167.68 today, -6.2%, ~9.3x my 2027 EPS est of $18.08\n\nDoes token bloat get priced out (models get trimmed to use", "url": "https://x.com/BellwetherFCF/status/2120229136115372141"}, {"author_id": "61479200", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:48:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120227213237010939"], "id": "2120227213237010939", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120210355615842428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 89 more cost for the same score is a steep tax just to spawn some subagents.", "url": "https://x.com/InsomniaLK/status/2120227213237010939"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1063654146203574272", "name": "Yuvraj Angad Singh", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 111, "following_coun